        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits; It Takes a Thief; Gangsta's Paradise; My Soul; Pastime Paradise\n- People: Coolio; Stevie Wonder\n- Concepts: compilation albums; sampling\n\nFacts:\n- Stevie Wonder released the song \"Pastime Paradise\" in 1976.\n- Coolio released the compilation album \"Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits\" in 2001.\n- \"Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits\" is a compilation album by rapper Coolio.\n- Songs on \"Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits\" originally appeared on Coolio's first three albums: \"It Takes a Thief\", \"Gangsta's Paradise\", and \"My Soul\".\n- Coolio's song \"Gangsta's Paradise\" samples the chorus and instrumentation of Stevie Wonder's song \"Pastime Paradise\".",
